----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
----------------------------------------------------------------------

GIF encoding uses the pure-Rust `gif` crate (MIT or Apache-2.0). Earlier plans to ship
gifski (AGPL) as a separate binary were dropped; Vuoom bundles no AGPL code.

Main components and their licences are listed at
https://razee4315.github.io/Vuoom/licenses/

A complete, generated list of third-party dependencies and their licenses
will be produced with `cargo about` / `cargo deny` and bundled in the
installer and the in-app About → Licenses screen before release.
